格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Behavior discipline for coding agents: read-before-write enforcement, failure convergence, write verification with auto-rollback, and a high-risk command gate. Ships FULL plugin/hook adapters for DSH, Claude Code, Codex, and Pi, plus a host-agnostic SOFT skill with ADAPTIVE adapt","id":"gh:1405528697","install_available":false,"language":"JavaScript","name":"behavior-enhancer-generic","slug":"Zoria-Lind/behavior-enhancer-generic","topics":["ai-agent","claude-code-plugin","claude-code-skill","codex-plugin","codex-skill","dsh-plugin","dsh-skill","guardrails","multi-host","pi-coding-agent","pi-package"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Behavior discipline for coding agents: read-before-write enforcement, failure convergence, write ver"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"ification with auto-rollback, and a high-risk command gate. Ships FULL plugin/hook adapters for DSH,"},{"id":"p1s3","text":" Claude Code, Codex, and Pi, plus a host-agnostic SOFT skill with ADAPTIVE adapt"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# behavior-enhancer-generic"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**English** · 中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"The behaviour design of `dsh-behavior-enhancer`, shipped as a **cross-host dual-form product**:"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"- **Plugin form (FULL)**: where the host exposes runtime interception, you get real enforcement — ve"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"toes, write verification, auto-rollback;\n- **Skill form (SOFT)**: where the host only gives an agent"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"-facing channel, you get behavioural guidance (self-discipline rules)."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"Same semantics, different enforcement strength. **No FULL claims we cannot back, and no pretending S"},{"id":"p6s2","text":", different enforcement strength. **No FULL claims we cannot back, and no pretending SOFT is FULL.**"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Which host gets which form"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"| Host | Form | What to install | Status |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| Claude Code | FULL (8 fea"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"tures) | `adapters/claude-code/` — plugin (F3b is implemented as a concurrency-window veto) | engine"},{"id":"p8s3","text":"-level tests **14/14**, dogfooding |\n| Codex | FULL (8 features) | `adapters/codex/` — `config.toml`"},{"id":"p8s4","text":" hooks or plugin manifest | protocol tests 13/13, ignition-tested on the desktop build |\n| Pi | FULL"},{"id":"p8s5","text":" (7 features + half of F9) | `adapters/pi/` — pi extension | protocol tests 11/11, live-tested on a "},{"id":"p8s6","text":"real install |\n| DSH | FULL | `adapters/dsh/` — installable plugin (all modules of the original, plu"},{"id":"p8s7","text":"s F1 read-before-write and two fixes) | all-module mock-ctx tests pass, real-install test pending |\n"},{"id":"p8s8","text":"| Any other host | SOFT + ADAPTIVE | `skill/SKILL.md` §8: the agent self-builds an adapter from `cor"},{"id":"p8s9","text":"e/adapter-template.md` (conservative testing, conservative FULL, written report) | published form |"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"**Install on Claude Code (one command)**:"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"For local development you can instead use `claude --plugin-dir \"<repo>\\adapters\\claude-code\"` or\n`CL"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"AUDE_CODE_PLUGIN_DIRS=...\\adapters\\claude-code` (see\n`adapters/claude-code/README.md`) — **pick one,"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"IN_DIRS=...\\adapters\\claude-code` (see\n`adapters/claude-code/README.md`) — **pick one, never both.**"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## The four-state activation model"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Every feature activates independently, and its state is decided by the **host's capability surface**"},{"id":"p13s2","text":" — never by user or agent preference:"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"| State | Meaning |\n| :--- | :--- |\n| NATIVE | The host already does this (only claimed when **measu"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"red**); the skill stays quiet |\n| FULL | Plugin-level takeover (veto / write verification / rollback"},{"id":"p14s3","text":") |\n| SOFT | Behavioural guidance (instructions, flow, decision trees) |\n| DISABLED | We do not pret"},{"id":"p14s4","text":"end a capability exists |"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"There are no `if DSH / elif ClaudeCode` branches — only capabilities. Full design in\n`generic-skill_"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"plan_v1.md`; the feature × capability matrix in\n`core/audit.md`; cross-host shared semantics (tokens"},{"id":"p15s3","text":", pattern tables, thresholds, TTL, tier ladder) in\n`core/semantics.md`."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"> Note: those design documents (`core/`, `generic-skill_plan_v1.md`) are **Chinese-only** for now. E"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"nglish readers can work from this README plus the per-adapter READMEs."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## Relationship to the DSH plugin"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"The DSH adapter started from the original plugin `dsh-behavior-enhancer` (a separate repo) and then "},{"id":"p18s2","text":"added the generic work. From there the two **evolve independently — there is no sync mechanism**: wh"},{"id":"p18s3","text":"en one side produces a better rule, the other copies it by hand if it is worth it. **Install one or "},{"id":"p18s4","text":"the other, never both**\n(see `adapters/dsh/README.md`)."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## Repository layout"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"## Tests"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## Links"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"- **Free SOFT version** (pure SKILL.md, works with any compatible host, no executable code): Agensi "},{"id":"p24s2","text":"— Behavior Enhancer. The FULL version in this repo remains the only complete form; the two feed each"},{"id":"p24s3","text":" other.\n- Claude Market — Claude Code plugin directory (behavior-enhancer entry).\n- Claude Plugin Hu"},{"id":"p24s4","text":"b — plugin directory (verified listing)"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"MIT — see LICENSE. The rules started from the DSH version and have evolved independently since."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
